WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.640
<v Narrator><i>The scouts find Circe singing at her loom while enchanted wolves and lions fawn around them.</i>

2
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:16.130
<v Narrator><i>All but Eurylochus enter.</i>

3
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:24.020
<v Narrator><i>Circe serves drugged food and strikes them with her wand.</i>

4
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:31.670
<v Narrator><i>The men become pigs in body while retaining human minds.</i>

5
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:38.080
<v Narrator><i>Circe shuts them in pens and throws them acorns.</i>

6
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:51.890
<v Eurylochus>They are gone, Odysseus — all of them! They went in at the shining doors and not one came out. I waited long, and called, and no man answered.
